<section class="section" style="padding-top:20px;">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <span class="kicker">Open Roles</span>
    <h2>Where You'd Fit In</h2>
    <p>Four roles, one small team — you'll touch more of the product than you would anywhere bigger.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="job-grid">
    <div class="job-card reveal">
      <h3>Sales Representative</h3>
      <span class="job-meta">Full-time · Remote-friendly</span>
      <p class="job-desc">You'll own the pipeline end to end — finding businesses drowning in manual work, showing them what KineSys can automate, and closing the deal.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Prospect and qualify new leads</li>
        <li>Run demos of our agents and RPA work</li>
        <li>Own the deal from first call to signed contract</li>
        <li>Work directly with founders on pricing & scoping</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="job-apply" href="mailto:careers@kinesys.io?subject=Application%20—%20Sales%20Representative&body=Hi%20KineSys%2C%0A%0AI'm%20applying%20for%20the%20Sales%20Representative%20role.%0A%0APortfolio%2FLinkedIn%3A%20%0A%0AResume%20attached.">Apply for this role →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="job-card reveal">
      <h3>RPA Engineer</h3>
      <span class="job-meta">Full-time · Remote-friendly</span>
      <p class="job-desc">You'll design and maintain the bots that keep our clients' back offices running — reliable, monitored, and built to survive contact with messy real-world systems.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Build bots in Automation Anywhere & Power Automate</li>
        <li>Integrate with ERPs, CRMs, and legacy systems</li>
        <li>Own monitoring, exception handling & maintenance</li>
        <li>Work directly with clients on process design</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="job-apply" href="mailto:careers@kinesys.io?subject=Application%20—%20RPA%20Engineer&body=Hi%20KineSys%2C%0A%0AI'm%20applying%20for%20the%20RPA%20Engineer%20role.%0A%0AGitHub%2FPortfolio%3A%20%0A%0AResume%20attached.">Apply for this role →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="job-card reveal">
      <h3>Full Stack Engineer</h3>
      <span class="job-meta">Full-time · Remote-friendly</span>
      <p class="job-desc">You'll build the software behind our automations — dashboards, portals, and the internal tools that make agents usable by non-technical teams.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>React / Node.js across our client-facing products</li>
        <li>Design REST APIs and cloud-native services</li>
        <li>Ship fast — prototype to production in days</li>
        <li>Work closely with our AI & RPA engineers</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="job-apply" href="mailto:careers@kinesys.io?subject=Application%20—%20Full%20Stack%20Engineer&body=Hi%20KineSys%2C%0A%0AI'm%20applying%20for%20the%20Full%20Stack%20Engineer%20role.%0A%0AGitHub%2FPortfolio%3A%20%0A%0AResume%20attached.">Apply for this role →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="job-card reveal">
      <h3>AI Engineer</h3>
      <span class="job-meta">Full-time · Remote-friendly</span>
      <p class="job-desc">You'll design and ship the agentic systems at the core of what we sell — RAG pipelines, LLM orchestration, and copilots that run in production, not just in a demo.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Build agents on Bedrock, Azure AI Foundry & Copilot Studio</li>
        <li>Design RAG pipelines and document intelligence flows</li>
        <li>Own prompt & agent architecture end to end</li>
        <li>Ship PoCs fast, then harden them for production</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="job-apply" href="mailto:careers@kinesys.io?subject=Application%20—%20AI%20Engineer&body=Hi%20KineSys%2C%0A%0AI'm%20applying%20for%20the%20AI%20Engineer%20role.%0A%0AGitHub%2FPortfolio%3A%20%0A%0AResume%20attached.">Apply for this role →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

